# Show and Tell in a three-player game: "Each player may put an artifact, creature, enchantment, or land card from their hand
# onto the battlefield." Bot1 puts its Mother of Runes; Bot2 holds only a Narset, Parter of Veils (a planeswalker) and Lightning
# Bolts, nothing of the four types, and is not asked (! Choose; Narset stays in hand); Bot3, last in turn order, has one eligible card, the Sol
# Ring (the unscripted answer takes it), and keeps its Lightning Bolt. All enter together, each under its own controller.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Show and Tell
Mother of Runes
Plains
Plains
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Narset, Parter of Veils
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
Lightning Bolt
